{"id":"r740uue2trx4nmfflxi6c0o5f","title":"英伟达Q3营收1158亿美元同比增103%，Q4指引1300亿美元","originalTitle":null,"summary":"英伟达第三财季（截至2026年10月25日）营收1158亿美元，同比增长103%，非GAAP每股收益2.68美元，毛利率74.9%。公司预计第四财季营收1300亿美元（上下浮动3%），但未计入来自中国的数据中心计算收入。财报公布后英伟达盘后一度涨约2.7%。","reason":"原文给出了Q3营收、毛利率、Q4指引及中国收入未计入的影响，读者可据此判断其业务增长动力和未来预期。","source":{"name":"PANews"},"links":{"original":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a1eb66-d586-73e7-8fce-de24f7545047"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T21:25:49.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-17T22:04:36.505Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-17T22:04:36.505Z","category":"stock-us","tags":["财报","NVIDIA"],"score":95,"selected":true,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"63a59ec7-f662-435a-92d4-45fae978f420","title":"英伟达Q3营收1158亿美元同比增103% Q4指引1300亿超预期"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"63a59ec7-f662-435a-92d4-45fae978f420","title":"英伟达Q3营收1158亿美元同比增103% Q4指引1300亿超预期"}],"topics":[{"slug":"nvidia","name":"NVIDIA / 英伟达"},{"slug":"earnings","name":"财报"}],"indexable":true,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"f66SSjzyZeMs","reportCount":2,"additionalSourceCount":1},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}